{
  "id": "GEN.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Giing'Eeta 18",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu geeheeleesa gideaba gayghwanyas baleanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghwahidu NG'UTAMIIDA headaanyi nea gwanda guumda saboojiga Mamre, nea goopteada aba ghuuta maheemajeandaanyi nea gwaju daknooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagatkat gheanyangaaschi ak ghoang'wearda, ak ghwadaah fih samwagu nea ghamiinaada aba madeadaanyi. Hean nea ghwadaah fiisu, ghang'eat ak ghoang'eada ng'weega ghuuta maheemajeandaanyi ak ghwadeapta, ak gwatkuy ea ghwahita ng'eanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayi, “Ea ng'utamiideanyu, iyoadaayi gideaba geawooschi doabiiwaat aba madeedeang'wa, ea adoasuuchi gheeda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anung' deaneegwa beesu ng'ay, ak goohuunyi geeshangeagwa, ak goofuufchi aba guumda geeta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geayeaneegwa mukaateeheeni mwanang', ak abeeda ghoanyaschi uurda, ama ng'ata ghoamuuschi aweayeena nea noahidu gheeda soomjeandeang'wa.” Ak gwayeesha, “Sinda gida inyaashti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata ghwalamwajaada Abrahamu ak gawa jeeda maheemajeandaanyi heeda Sara, ak gwayeesha, “Lamwaja geani dearanga miyaasiin ak giinyiidi gweeraji samwagu, ak giiwaali mukaatajeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghafwach Abrahamu ea ghwahita heetugwa ak gweadu meayda riishaat bea banyeega miyaas, ak ghoadaw soomjeanda ak ghwalamwach ghoawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hit gageanu eanooga ea nagheedeesh, sea meayda gwachi siiwu, ak ghwayiin madeanyaawa; ak ghamiinaada aba guumda geeta nea gweagiischi saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda saawa ak gwayeesha niny, “Gwandeenu Sarayiheeda was gatmoadaang'u?” Ak gwayeesha, “Gwanda jeeda maheemajeanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Gaydabiigu headaang'u gweanyiin sheedeaba shageash, nea Sarayiheeda was gatmoadaang'u gajea niji baleanda.” Nea ghoaleaydiit Sara aba gidaghuuta maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damani Abrahamu ea Sara ea niwoosiidi, niiw gweargwa; nea Sara abeeda ea ninaawa damanda gadeemga bea jeata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaak reari Sara nea gaba geaw nea gwayi, “Iinukwa naawaasiichi, ak eara siyeedeanyu ea niwaasiidi, gaygutaamu dandeawa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Abrahamu, “Ghwasaan anda Sara ghwaak reari, nea gwayi, ‘Aba huumwa gaydaamu danyas baleanda nea nukwa naawaasiichi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada gwanda ng'asheanda hang'waay aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA? Iihita damandida gaydabiigu headaang'u gweanyiin doomeelda, abeeda Sara gajea ninyas baleanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwashaang' Sara nea gwayi, “Aniini mwayaagi reari”; aba gideaba ghabeal. Gwayeesha niny, “Manda, niyaagi reari.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu gooyeawda Sodoma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eatng'eat fugiga ghabeawa hoowa, ak gang'ula Sodoma; ak goodeayi sea Abrahamu ak goohiimsa naweeda ak ghwanung'waada gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Maydafunya Abrahamu gida jea dasin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jeacheangaaschi gayghwasaang'ayiit ak ghoah eemeeda mideawa uurda, nea aba niny gayghoadaw geat ghawooda eemoojiga sean bea muunda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda, aba gideaba naaloachi niny, ak abeeda ghoamu gwareekusa diibigaaschi sea fugeaba gheanyi ghoang'waay ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA ak geasinyi ng'asheega doobiiweadi ea gea hit; ak abeeda ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Abrahamu gidaheeleesa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Iinukwa shooka Sodoma ea Gomora aahaw nea riing'eega nyaawa ea munyas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaydararang'aada dadaa ea nisin gili siikuula ak ghwahidu heedeanyuun; aniini huumwa gil, gaydanal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eatng'eat fugiga ak gaweay Sodoma; nea Abrahamu ghamiinaada aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goosiipsa Abrahamu ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i gigasayi lasa uhuuda fuga doobiiweadi ea gea munyasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa iideepa gwanda fih haradam ea damanamughuush doobiiweadi jeeda mujiini; ang'iing'i gaynyarja mujiini ak ea miighuuhi aba badahuukeaba fugiga doobiiweadi aharadam ea damanamughuushiini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa nung' gwasheagiidaneey sinoodeaba ng'asheanji, nuusta siida doabiiwaat ak gawa hoorgeeda siida muy, abeeda gaygwasawana fuga doobiiweadi aba badahuuka fuga munyas! Gagasa gwasheagiidaneey ng'asheanji! Neada siida jea goorgweaksa ng'eanyiisean maygwasin gitoabiiwi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Iyaanyaschi fih haradam ea damanamughuush doobiiweadi aba jeeda mujiineeda Sodoma, abeeda gaydaaghu ng'eanyiisean aba badahuuka nyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Abrahamu nea gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, samsean aba hang'ooynateanyu aba gideaba geabalooleey NG'UTAMIIDA, aniineeda was sigeeda ea deareeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ghwashoada fih muut aba jeeda fuga aharadam ea damanamughuush doobiiweadi? Gaynyarja mujiineesean aba gideaba ghwashoada fih muudi?” Ak gwayeesha, “Maydanyarja iyaanyaschi fih haradam ea muut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gicha ak gwayeesha niny, “Amadeepa gwanda hoowa fih haradam.” Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Aba badahuukeaba fiisu aharadamiin maydanyarja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
